Pharos OS
A project of CodeAIForge.

This product is licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0 (see LICENSE).

The repository contains no bundled third-party source code, except tables
generated from the Unicode Character Database (listed at the end). The user
programs built into Pharos OS boot images include compiled code from the
following third-party crates: `libm`, a Cargo dependency of `user/programs`
(D-016); `ed25519-compact`, a Cargo dependency of `crates/pharos-image`
(D-028; today used by `xtask` on the host only); and `smoltcp` with its
dependencies `bitflags`, `byteorder`, `cfg-if`, `hash32`, `heapless`,
`managed`, and `stable_deref_trait`, in the network service (`user/programs`,
D-034).

